0Backport","name":"No Backport","color":"c601a6","default":false,"description":"A PR that isn't to be backported to any release branch. (To be used as a flag to other maintainers)"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunpy/sunpy/milestones/117","html_url":"https://github.com/sunpy/sunpy/milestone/117","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunpy/sunpy/milestones/117/labels","id":10223446,"node_id":"MI_kwDOACEKh84Am_9W","number":117,"title":"6.0.0","description":"","creator":{"login":"dstansby","id":6197628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTc2Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6197628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby","html_url":"https://github.com/dstansby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstansby/received_events","type":"User","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":22,"state":"open","created_at":"2023-11-23T11:05:39Z","updated_at":"2024-07-03T21:14:43Z","due_on":"2024-11-11T08:00:00Z","closed_at":null},"comments":7,"created_at":"2024-03-26T15:55:42Z","updated_at":"2024-07-05T01:34:52Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunpy/sunpy/pulls/7532","html_url":"https://github.com/sunpy/sunpy/pull/7532","diff_url":"https://github.com/sunpy/sunpy/pull/7532.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sunpy/sunpy/pull/7532.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"With Helioprojective frames, you can use `assume_spherical_screen` to transform coordinates into another frame. The screen's center is configurable, but the radius is always such that the screen passes through the Sun. That's usually the right choice, but a user (i.e. me) might want to change the radius of the screen (with it then not passing through the Sun). This PR allows that. Delightfully, the spherical screen part of `Helioprojective.make_3d` is written in full generality, so all that's needed is an argument to `assume_spherical_screen` allowing a radius to be passed in.

It looks like there weren't any tests for `assume_spherical_screen` (though there was coverage through examples in the docs), so I added a one and exercise this option.

My use case here is making videos with WISPR on PSP, which involves compositing two images from the two imagers, which are taken at slightly different times and locations. It's a wide FOV that doesn't include the Sun, but the FOV is ~fixed in helioprojective coordinates. A spherical screen passing through the Sun starts to be uncomfortably close to PSP (perihelia near 10 R_sun, while traveling ~10 R_sun/day). Projecting the images onto that kinda-close screen to composite them adds a bit of jittery parallax for the stars, which makes videos look a bit jumpy. As an experiment, I'm instead projecting onto a screen at infinity, which has the stars move very smoothly and evenly through the FOV---in trade, the coronal structures should have a bit of parallax, but since they're large, diffuse, and evolving, it's less noticeable. (My only goal in this is pretty videos.)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunpy/sunpy/issues/7532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunpy/sunpy/issues/7532/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},"comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunpy/sunpy/issues/comments/2209847490","html_url":"https://github.com/sunpy/sunpy/pull/7532#issuecomment-2209847490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunpy/sunpy/issues/7532","id":2209847490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACEKh86Dt5jC","user":{"login":"wtbarnes","id":8676141,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYxNDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8676141?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtbarnes","html_url":"https://github.com/wtbarnes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtbarnes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtbarnes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtbarnes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtbarnes/starred{/owner}{/repo}